post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Gamepads are read straight from /dev/input/event*, which needs the 'input' group:

  sudo usermod -aG input $USER      # then log out and back in

Press START on the pad to join as player 2 (a second pad takes player 1); the
keyboard keeps working for both players either way. Without the group, or with
no pad plugged in, the game runs on the keyboard as usual. To see what the game
makes of a pad: OLIGARCHY_TANKS_PAD_DEBUG=1 oligarchy-tanks
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
